      "role": "user",
      "content": "those are good starting points. can you go a bit deeper on the rule-of-law aspect though? my students need some more philosophical weight for their cases. like, instead of just saying \"it's the law,\" how would a debater argue that strict enforcement is actually a moral necessity for a functioning society? i want them to be able to present it as a principled stance rather than just a technical one.",
